    "name": "\u5e78\u8fd0\u4ff1\u4e50\u90e8\uff1a\u522e\u522e\u4e50|Lukcy Club:Scratcher",
    "steam_appid": 2850460,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you can use dozens of different God of Wealth symbols and winning symbols to form special scratch cards, and then scratch for bonuses to help you win the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scratch &amp; Win</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/cc6dfe3b40d126de799887ea61a14261.avif?t=1755241205\" width=384 height=192 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It follows the traditional scratch-off gameplay. If you scratch any non-numeric symbol, you can win the bonus amount shown below the symbol.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbols</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/d1a66af89cbb322e18ae69766ca20782.avif?t=1755241205\" width=676 height=258 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a total of 72 symbols in 6 categories in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase symbols from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more symbols you have, the higher your winning odds will be.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Symbols have attributes (such as sports, Chinese characters, Chinese zodiac signs, etc.). Different symbols can interact with different lucky coins to obtain higher rewards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Materials</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/d518642544eef648435b3772a6630544.avif?t=1755241205\" width=256 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple ways to add materials to symbols in the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Silver</strong>: Bonus + 2.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gold</strong>: Bonus + 5.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stone</strong>: No bonus. Each time it appears, there is a 10% chance of it becoming a diamond symbol.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coal</strong>: No bonus. After it appears ten times, it will turn into a diamond symbol.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glass</strong>: The bonus is doubled, but there is a 1/4 chance that the card will disappear when played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diamond</strong>: The bonus is doubled and can be regarded as any type universally.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lucky Coins</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/7386181e8b4f589e206bde4da584b7f2.avif?t=1755241205\" width=650 height=218 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level is cleared, players can purchase lucky coins from the store.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different lucky coins have different effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revolver</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850460/extras/905f42575a3fcec7a34c82f953c51f89.avif?t=1755241205\" data-has-big width=800 height=480 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't reach the required points, you need to load a bullet into the revolver and shoot yourself.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the bullet is a blank, the game continues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of bullets will keep accumulating.</p></li></ul>",
